<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Terms of Service - ResonaTale</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
        :root{--primary:#6366F1;--bg:#0F172A;--card:#1E293B;--text:#FFF;--muted:#94A3B8;--border:#334155}
        body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;padding:2rem 1rem}
        .container{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--card);padding:3rem;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
        h1{font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),#8B5CF6);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}
        .subtitle{color:var(--muted);font-size:0.875rem;margin-bottom:2rem}
        h2{font-size:1.5rem;margin:2rem 0 1rem;color:var(--primary)}
        h3{font-size:1.125rem;margin:1.5rem 0 0.75rem}
        p,li{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:1rem}
        ul{margin-left:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
        a{color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none}
        a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
        .back-btn{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:2rem;color:var(--primary);font-weight:600}
        strong{color:var(--text)}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <a href="/" class="back-btn">← Back to ResonaTale</a>
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Last Updated: February 14, 2026</p>

        <h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using ResonaTale ("Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree to all the terms, you may not access the Service.</p>
        <p><strong>Service Provider:</strong> ResonaTale, accessible at <a href="https://www.resonatale.com">www.resonatale.com</a></p>
        <p><strong>Contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:admin@resonatale.com">admin@resonatale.com</a></p>

        <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>ResonaTale provides an AI-powered platform that allows users to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Upload personal photos</li>
            <li>Record and clone their voice using AI technology</li>
            <li>Generate personalized video content narrated in their cloned voice</li>
            <li>Download and share the resulting films</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. User Accounts and Registration</h2>
        <h3>3.1 Account Creation</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>You must be at least 18 years old to use the Service</li>
            <li>You must provide accurate and complete information during registration</li>
            <li>You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account credentials</li>
            <li>You agree to notify us immediately of any unauthorized access</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>3.2 Account Responsibilities</h3>
        <p>You are solely responsible for all activities that occur under your account. We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms.</p>

        <h2>4. Content and Intellectual Property</h2>
        <h3>4.1 Your Content</h3>
        <p>You retain ownership of all content you upload (photos, voice recordings). By using the Service, you grant us a limited license to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Process your photos and voice to generate your personalized films</li>
            <li>Store your content securely on our servers</li>
            <li>Use AI models to create derivative works based on your input</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>4.2 Content Requirements</h3>
        <p>You represent and warrant that:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>You own or have the right to use all uploaded content</li>
            <li>Your content does not violate any third-party rights</li>
            <li>Your content complies with all applicable laws</li>
            <li>You will not upload content depicting minors</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>4.3 Prohibited Content</h3>
        <p>You may not create or share content that is:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Illegal, harmful, threatening, abusive, or defamatory</li>
            <li>Infringing on intellectual property rights</li>
            <li>Depicting violence, hate speech, or harassment</li>
            <li>Sexually explicit or obscene</li>
            <li>Impersonating others without consent</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Voice Cloning and AI Technology</h2>
        <h3>5.1 Consent and Authorization</h3>
        <p>By recording your voice, you explicitly consent to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>AI-based voice cloning and synthesis</li>
            <li>Use of your cloned voice in films generated by the Service</li>
            <li>Storage of voice data for Service operation</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>5.2 Restrictions</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>You may only clone your own voice or voices you have explicit permission to use</li>
            <li>You may not use cloned voices for fraudulent, deceptive, or illegal purposes</li>
            <li>You may not impersonate public figures or celebrities</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Payment and Billing (EU & US)</h2>
        <h3>6.1 Pricing</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Preview generation is free</li>
            <li>Full film generation costs $19.99 USD per film</li>
            <li>Credits can be purchased in amounts from $20 to $500</li>
            <li>All prices are in USD and exclude applicable taxes</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>6.2 Taxes</h3>
        <p><strong>EU Users (GDPR Compliant):</strong> VAT will be automatically calculated and added at checkout based on your location. Prices shown are exclusive of VAT.</p>
        <p><strong>US Users:</strong> State and local sales taxes will be calculated at checkout based on your billing address.</p>

        <h3>6.3 Payment Processing</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Payments are processed securely through Stripe</li>
            <li>We do not store your payment card information</li>
            <li>All transactions are subject to fraud detection</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>6.4 Refunds</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Credits are non-refundable once purchased</li>
            <li>If a film generation fails due to technical issues, credits will be automatically refunded to your account</li>
            <li>Refund requests for exceptional circumstances should be sent to <a href="mailto:admin@resonatale.com">admin@resonatale.com</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2>7. EU-Specific Rights (GDPR)</h2>
        <p>If you are located in the European Union, you have additional rights under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR):</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Right of Access:</strong> Request a copy of your personal data</li>
            <li><strong>Right to Rectification:</strong> Correct inaccurate personal data</li>
            <li><strong>Right to Erasure:</strong> Request deletion of your data ("right to be forgotten")</li>
            <li><strong>Right to Restrict Processing:</strong> Limit how we use your data</li>
            <li><strong>Right to Data Portability:</strong> Receive your data in a machine-readable format</li>
            <li><strong>Right to Object:</strong> Opt-out of certain data processing activities</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:admin@resonatale.com">admin@resonatale.com</a></p>

        <h2>8. Service Availability</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>We strive for 99.9% uptime but do not guarantee uninterrupted service</li>
            <li>We may suspend the Service for maintenance with reasonable notice</li>
            <li>Film generation typically takes 1-3 minutes but may vary</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>9. Prohibited Uses</h2>
        <p>You may not:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Use the Service for any illegal purpose</li>
            <li>Attempt to reverse engineer or scrape our AI models</li>
            <li>Automate access to the Service using bots</li>
            <li>Resell or redistribute generated content as a service</li>
            <li>Use the Service to create deepfakes for deception</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>10. Termination</h2>
        <h3>10.1 Termination by You</h3>
        <p>You may delete your account at any time through the account settings. Unused credits will be forfeited upon account deletion.</p>

        <h3>10.2 Termination by Us</h3>
        <p>We may suspend or terminate your account if:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>You violate these Terms</li>
            <li>Your use poses a security risk</li>
            <li>You engage in fraudulent activity</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>11. Disclaimers and Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p><strong>THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND.</strong> We do not guarantee:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Perfect voice cloning accuracy</li>
            <li>Specific quality of generated films</li>
            <li>Compatibility with all devices</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Limitation of Liability:</strong> To the maximum extent permitted by law, ResonaTale shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages exceeding the amount you paid in the past 12 months.</p>

        <h2>12. Indemnification</h2>
        <p>You agree to indemnify and hold ResonaTale harmless from any claims arising from your use of the Service or violation of these Terms.</p>

        <h2>13. Dispute Resolution</h2>
        <h3>13.1 Governing Law</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>EU Users:</strong> Disputes governed by laws of Ireland (our EU data processing location)</li>
            <li><strong>US Users:</strong> Disputes governed by laws of Illinois, United States</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>13.2 Arbitration (US Users)</h3>
        <p>US users agree to resolve disputes through binding arbitration rather than court litigation, except for small claims court matters.</p>

        <h2>14. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms at any time. Continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance of the new Terms. Material changes will be notified via email.</p>

        <h2>15. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>For questions about these Terms:</p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:admin@resonatale.com">admin@resonatale.com</a></p>
        <p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.resonatale.com">www.resonatale.com</a></p>

        <p style="margin-top:3rem;padding-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
            <strong>Effective Date:</strong> February 14, 2026<br>
            <strong>Version:</strong> 1.0
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
